&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Change the way the world travels&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Join the GetYourGuide journey to connect people with unforgettable travel experiences around the world. Millions look to us for unique activities they can trust, and it’s all powered by our commitment to make every single journey extraordinary - including yours.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ready to unlock your potential with a community of fellow explorers? Find your next role at our Berlin HQ or one of our local offices around the globe, from New York to Bangkok. Head to&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.getyourguide.careers/&quot;&gt;getyourguide.careers&lt;/a&gt; to take the first step.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Team Mission&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Strategic Partnerships is GetYourGuide&#39;s partner distribution channel. It generates a significant share of the company&#39;s revenue, with a team of 30 people across EMEA, the Americas and APAC. A dedicated partnership tech team sits in Product and Engineering; the Partnerships Director sets its product strategy.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Partners include online travel platforms, banks and loyalty programs, affiliate networks, travel agents and more.&amp;nbsp;The ambition is to triple the channel within three years. That means changing how the channel operates, not optimizing the current momentum.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Mission&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are hiring a director-level leader to run the Partnerships function. You will set the strategy for growing the partner channel, set the product direction for the partner platform, and directly lead teams across sales, account management, and strategy and operations. The function was brought together in 2026 from two teams and is being rebuilt around partner segments. You get to shape it from close to the ground up, with the COO as your sponsor, and you run it end to end from day one.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a highly visible role based in Berlin, working in a hybrid model. We offer a competitive relocation package to support your move—successful candidates will be expected to be based in Berlin or happy to relocate.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you will own&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A high-revenue channel and its P&amp;amp;L.&lt;/strong&gt; You set targets, own the forecast and partner economics, and run execution across EMEA, the Americas and APAC.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The strategy for how GetYourGuide wins through partners.&lt;/strong&gt; You decide where we play and how we win in each segment, from global OTAs and loyalty programs to affiliate and travel-agent programs, and you make the calls on what we will not do.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The largest partnerships in travel.&lt;/strong&gt; You personally lead negotiations with our largest partners and set terms that hold as volume scales.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The supply story.&lt;/strong&gt; GetYourGuide has one of the largest experiences inventories in the market. You decide how we use it commercially with partners: what we offer exclusively, where, and on what terms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The product direction for the partner platform.&lt;/strong&gt; Partner technology is built in Product, but you set what it builds: the segment problems worth solving, the research behind them, and the roadmap they add up to.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A team of about 30, and its next shape.&lt;/strong&gt; Regional leads, segment owners and a central RevOps team. You design the org, decide your leadership bench and raise the bar.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The operating rhythm.&lt;/strong&gt; QBRs, metrics and prioritization that turn strategy into quarters of growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Must-haves&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;15+ years of experience,&lt;/strong&gt; ideally at VP or Director level, within a B2B SaaS or marketplace environment. Experience in Business Development and/or Revenue Operations (RevOps) is a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Business unit leadership, not only sales leadership.&lt;/strong&gt; You have run a commercial P&amp;amp;L that combined several go-to-market motions (enterprise business development, account management, programmatic long-tail programs) and a team of 20 or more.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategy authorship.&lt;/strong&gt; You have written a channel or segment strategy with clear choices and trade-offs, and then executed it.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Dealmaking.&lt;/strong&gt; You have personally negotiated complex commercial agreements with large partners and can point to the terms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;People leadership.&lt;/strong&gt; A track record of recruiting, developing and retaining strong commercial talent, including managing managers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Product fluency.&lt;/strong&gt; You can translate partner needs into problem statements a product team can prioritize, and you have worked closely with product and engineering leaders before.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Analytical rigor.&lt;/strong&gt; You read the data yourself, challenge inconsistencies, and diagnose funnel and unit-economics problems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Execution discipline.&lt;/strong&gt; A high say-do ratio, sustained through an operating cadence rather than heroics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Communication.&lt;/strong&gt; You negotiate, influence and build relationships at C-level with partners and internally.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice-to-haves&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience at scale ups or B2B Saas&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Marketplace or two-sided business experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with affiliate, loyalty or fintech partnerships.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How we’ll make your career journey extraordinary&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Annual personal growth budget and mentorship programs for continuous learning and development&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work from anywhere in the world for 30 days per year&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A hybrid working approach with three days of in office collaboration (Mon, Tue, Thur) and two days of optional at home focus time.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Opportunities to collaborate and socialize with team members through quarterly team events and yearly company-wide events&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monthly transportation and fitness budget&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Discounts for you, your friends, and family on GetYourGuide activities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Language reimbursement program&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Health and wellness benefits&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;And more…&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Change the way the world travels&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Join the GetYourGuide journey to connect people with unforgettable travel experiences around the world. Millions look to us for unique activities they can trust, and it’s all powered by our commitment to make every single journey extraordinary - including yours.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ready to unlock your potential with a community of fellow explorers? Find your next role at our Berlin HQ or one of our local offices around the globe, from New York to Bangkok. Head to&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.getyourguide.careers/&quot;&gt;getyourguide.careers&lt;/a&gt; to take the first step.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team mission&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As Director of Product, Growth, you will be the most senior product leader for our Growth organization, joining the Chief Product Officer&#39;s staff. Your mandate is to build each product in our growth and marketing portfolio in the right direction, in close alignment with our business goals — while always delivering real value back to our users, not just building to what marketing needs.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Marketing channels that have historically been siloed are converging, and you will drive the scale, leverage, and consistently excellent user experience that convergence makes possible. This is one of the largest and most consequential product scopes at GetYourGuide: it sits atop the single largest line item on our P&amp;amp;L outside of revenue itself, spanning Landing Pages, Paid Search Technology, Strategic Partnerships, Lifecycle Marketing, and our Creative Platform (which includes our Marketing Technology Platform and Creator tooling). You will likely own or co-own strategy for a broader cluster as well.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Equally important, you will build a great product management organization — hiring, developing, and growing PMs across the growth, data, UX, and platform archetypes that a world-class marketing product org needs. You will lead a team of several direct reports (a mix of product leads and managers) across a wider organization, partnering closely with senior stakeholders on the business side.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a role with clear, measurable success criteria and a genuine path toward broader scope and impact as our growth investment continues to compound.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own a cohesive product strategy across Growth that ties investment to business impact in both absolute and relative terms — raising the bar on how opportunities are assessed and influencing prioritization across product and marketing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Champion user experience as a first-class lever in every product you and your team build, even highly technical ones — using &quot;why is this good for our users&quot; to guide decisions alongside business goals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive convergence across historically siloed marketing channels, building scale and leverage while maintaining a consistently excellent, trustworthy user experience across all of them.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build, grow, and uplevel a high-performing PM organization spanning growth, data, UX, and platform archetypes — hiring well, developing talent, and partnering closely with senior individual contributors.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Operate effectively in a functional matrix, partnering with senior business leaders (including on paid search) where priorities are at times business-driven, while representing user and product interests at every level.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate company-level strategy into a compelling long-term vision for Growth product, build alignment across cross-functional and executive stakeholders, and create excitement for that vision.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bring a clear point of view on how AI is changing product management and the growth/martech space, and help your organization put that into practice.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Should Bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A proven track record leading marketing/growth product organizations at scale in consumer technology, as the senior product leader across a broad, multi-team scope.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep experience in paid search product, plus meaningful experience in at least one other channel — lifecycle, affiliates/partnerships, or creative — rather than being a single-channel specialist.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort operating against large marketing budgets ($100M+), with the commercial and analytical judgment that scale requires.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record of building and upskilling a product organization — hiring, developing, and growing PMs and PM leaders across different archetypes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience navigating genuine trade-offs between user experience and business/marketing goals, with a clear point of view on how to make that call.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong stakeholder management skills, with experience operating in a functional matrix alongside senior business partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent written and verbal communication skills in English.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bonus: experience working on a marketplace (consumer marketplaces ideal; B2B marketplaces with an SMB focus are also valuable) — supply-and-demand dynamics shouldn&#39;t need explaining.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bonus: additional breadth across partnerships/affiliate marketing, creator products, or marketing technology platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bonus: experience with in-house advertising or monetization products is a plus, though not the immediate focus of this role.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How we’ll make your career journey extraordinary&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Annual personal growth budget and mentorship programs for continuous learning and development&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work from anywhere in the world for 30 days per year&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A hybrid working approach with three days of in office collaboration (Mon, Tue, Thur) and two days of optional at home focus time.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Opportunities to collaborate and socialize with team members through quarterly team events and yearly company-wide events&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monthly transportation and fitness budget&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Discounts for you, your friends, and family on GetYourGuide activities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Language reimbursement program&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Health and wellness benefits&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;And more…&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How to apply&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Submit your CV/resume in English using the form below. For tips and insights into our hiring process and culture, check out ‘&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.getyourguide.careers/how-we-hire&quot;&gt;how we hire&lt;/a&gt;’ and ‘&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.getyourguide.careers/life-at-getyourguide&quot;&gt;life at GetYourGuide&lt;/a&gt;’. If you have any further questions, please don’t hesitate to get in touch at &lt;a href=&quot;mailto:[email:1]&quot;&gt;[email:1]&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We’re an equal opportunities employer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our commitment is that every qualified person will be evaluated according to their skills regardless of age, gender identity, ethnicity, sexual orientation, disability status, or religion. Please refrain from including your picture and age with your application.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Change the way the world travels&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
