&lt;p&gt;Ready to unlock your potential with a community of fellow explorers? Find your next role at our Berlin HQ or one of our local offices around the globe, from New York to Bangkok. Head to&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.getyourguide.careers/&quot;&gt;getyourguide.careers&lt;/a&gt; to take the first step.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team mission&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our ambition is to expand our market leader position across Europe, the Middle East and Africa - our largest regions. We&#39;re looking for an exceptional commercial leader to own and scale our EMEA supply strategy, based in Berlin with regular travel to our local offices across the region.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Reporting to the VP Supply and Sales, you&#39;ll take full ownership of commercial performance across EMEA, including P&amp;amp;L responsibility, leading leaders across sales and account management in seven offices. This is as much a people leadership role as a commercial one: you&#39;ll develop senior managers, while staying close to the numbers to know exactly where the business stands - and where to move next.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your mission&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own supply performance across EMEA, with full P&amp;amp;L responsibility for the Sales organisation in the region&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expand GetYourGuide&#39;s supply coverage and drive new revenue through best-in-class sales execution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Raise the commercial performance of existing supply partners and secure strategic supply advantages, including preferred terms, through strong account management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead and develop a multi-layered team of sales, account management and supply community management leaders across our EMEA offices in Berlin, Amsterdam, Barcelona, Dubai, London, Paris and Rome&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coach and grow people managers within your organisation, building a strong bench of future leaders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exhibit proactive thought leadership to refine and build the playbook for a world-class sales organisation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with partner teams to help shape the tooling and processes towards an AI-empowered sales organisation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Represent GetYourGuide at key industry conferences and in meetings with CEOs and senior leaders of major attractions, theme parks and other key supply partners&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build a healthy, high-performing team culture rooted in GetYourGuide&#39;s core values, acting as a role model for personal growth, trust and passion&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with Marketing, Operations and other teams to accelerate our growth flywheel&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your toolkit&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record of consistently exceeding targets in an ambitious, quota-carrying sales environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years in senior commercial leadership roles (Head of, Director or VP), including demonstrated experience leading leaders across multiple markets or locations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience across both new business acquisition and account management/retention&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Background in high-growth marketplace, e-commerce or SaaS businesses&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong people leader with a track record of recruiting, developing and retaining top commercial talent&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Entrepreneurial mindset that thrives in scaling, fast-changing environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Highly collaborative, low-ego leadership style&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Outstanding communication, negotiation and influencing skills, with a natural ability to build relationships and a win-win mentality&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Data-driven and results-oriented, comfortable owning forecasts and commercial metrics&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Based in Berlin or willing to relocate, and excited to travel regularly (up to 30%) to develop local teams and build relationships across the region&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Extras that give you an edge&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prior experience as a General Manager, or an earlier background in consulting&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep understanding of the EMEA travel or experiences market and its competitive landscape&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;German language skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;German or other European language skills&lt;/li&gt;
